        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PUNCH FOREVER is a physics-based brawler, the ultimate version of the Ludum Dare 54 game jam winner <i>Fun #1</i>, featuring new game modes on top the original level campaign: a 2-player battle arena and a hardcore survival mode.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIMITED SPACE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >26 original  levels with fair challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the timings to perfect your reflexes and accuracy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore mode to fight off enemy waves and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your abilities and unlock new perks by clearing stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARENA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb up the ladder by fighting opponents and raising bets by your rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or smash your friend at <strong>2-player hot seat</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > FOREVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\tAvailable for <strong>FREE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for PUNCH FOREVER <i><strong>on mobile</strong> to play with touch controls</i>.</p>",
